    "message": "Run the declared models where a model suite leaves selectors implicit\n\nThe relationship and queue factories and the misinformation check in\nWorldView read policy_registry keys directly, so a suite without\nper-domain selectors (Scenario editor presets, prepare without a\nregistry) ran legacy defaults while manifests and Checkpoints recorded\nthe suite's models (#169). They now resolve through selected_models.\n\nSuch a suite is signed model_suite@2, so a Checkpoint captured before is\nrefused instead of switching models mid-Run; a suite with every selector\nexplicit keeps @1. The behavior policy comparison now compares declared\nmodels only and refuses a Run recorded at @1 with implicit selectors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
